# Dokan Kits Project Overview

Dokan Kits is a feature-packed add-on designed to streamline and enhance the functionality of Dokan-powered multi-vendor marketplaces.

## Main Entry Points

- [wp-plugin-starter.php](mdc:wp-plugin-starter.php): Plugin bootstrap file that initializes the plugin
- [class-wp-plugin-starter.php](mdc:class-wp-plugin-starter.php): Main plugin class that handles initialization and bootstrapping

## Core Architecture

The plugin follows a modern architecture with:

- Dependency Injection using League Container
- PSR-4 autoloading with namespaces
- Service providers for modular functionality
- Feature-based organization

## Key Components

- **Core**: Foundation classes and interfaces in [includes/Core/](mdc:includes/Core)
- **Admin**: Admin dashboard and settings in [includes/Admin/](mdc:includes/Admin)
- **Features**: Modular features in [includes/Features/](mdc:includes/Features)
- **REST API**: REST controllers in [includes/REST/](mdc:includes/REST)
- **Frontend**: Frontend components in [src/frontend/](mdc:src/frontend)
- **React Admin**: React-based admin UI in [src/admin/](mdc:src/admin)

## Development Tools

- PHP: Composer, PHPUnit, PHPCS, PHPStan
- JavaScript: React, TypeScript, Webpack, Tailwind CSS
- Build tools: Yarn, ESLint, Stylelint
